子","kind":"person","person_id":"l05_5gh_nen","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"郭昌","kind":"person","person_id":"ey5_pne_opn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0211","start":211,"end":214,"surface":"浞野侯","kind":"person","person_id":"z0l_1wp_de1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0223","start":223,"end":226,"surface":"路充國","kind":"person","person_id":"l9a_lun_z7u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0232","start":232,"end":234,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p049","text":"烏維單于立十歳而死，子烏師廬立爲單于。年少，號爲兒單于。是歳元封六年也。自此之後，單于益西北，左方兵直雲中，右方直酒泉、燉煌郡。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"烏維單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"烏師廬","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0014","start":14,"end":18,"surface":"立爲單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"兒單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m049-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"wjt_htu_081_AABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-110","source_id":"s-sh